  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Qing Mao Mountain, the looping image wall in the secret cave shifts to a blood-bathed Flower Wine Monk who offers his entire inheritance if the finder will exterminate Gu Yue clan.",
      "chapters": [
        46
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
        "loc_secret_cave",
        "char_flower_wine_monk",
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that change, videos vanish and a blood line tells the finder to break the wall for a cavern entrance; the writing lasts only a few breaths before the wall turns ordinary again. Fang Yuan treats that rank five power inheritance as more valuable than keeping Jia Jin Sheng as a pawn, and names demonic cultivator inheritances as often carrying deadly tests.",
      "chapters": [
        47
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wall-message-and-path-opening",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_jia_jin_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan shaves the blank image wall with Moonlight Gu until a diagonal path opens downward into red-glowing soil. He classifies a strength inheritance as hurdles set on purpose for later generations, unlike a simple corpse legacy, and reads the Monk’s clear aim as nurturing an avenger against Gu Yue clan.",
      "chapters": [
        60
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wall-message-and-path-opening",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_moonlight_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before death the Monk used a Thousand Li Earthwolf Spider to dig that tunnel deep into the mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        61
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tunnel-and-first-barrier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_thousand_li_earthwolf_spider"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the tunnel end a huge rock blocks the way; Fang Yuan pulls White Boar Gu from an Earth Treasury Flower Gu planted there.",
      "chapters": [
        63
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tunnel-and-first-barrier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_white_boar_gu",
        "gu_earth_treasury_flower_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He treats pushing the rock with that strength boost as the first test, and judges the setup sincere rather than a trap.",
      "chapters": [
        64
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tunnel-and-first-barrier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan ranks the site as a micro-scale legacy with few items but a first barrier shaped to local conditions. By then he lists White Boar Gu, Jade Skin Gu, and Liquor worm among what he has taken, and treats Stealth Stone Gu as only barely part of the same line.",
      "chapters": [
        122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gu-gathered-along-the-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_white_boar_gu",
        "gu_jade_skin_gu",
        "gu_liquor_worm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A deeper barrier yields Earth Communication Ear Grass.",
      "chapters": [
        128
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gu-gathered-along-the-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_earth_communication_ear_grass"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan takes Chainsaw Golden Centipede at a deeper barrier, then finds Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus as a blue and white flower bud behind a crystal wall on the path.",
      "chapters": [
        162
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lotus-behind-the-crystal-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_chainsaw_golden_centipede",
        "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names the lotus the last inheritance of Flower Wine Monk. He already knew the Monk set the inheritance to take revenge on Gu Yue clan, and he treats removing that lotus from the clan spirit spring as ruin for the clan’s foundation whether the theft succeeds or fails.",
      "chapters": [
        163
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lotus-behind-the-crystal-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier, once Moonshadow Gu’s true effect is known, the blood-soaked image no longer fits the fourth-generation fight alone, and the inheritance becomes a mystery to him again.",
      "chapters": [
        156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lotus-behind-the-crystal-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_moonshadow_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The hurry follows the Monk fleeing First gen Gu Yue on the Thousand Li Earthwolf Spider, then hurriedly creating the secret cave and leaving the inheritance before dying.",
      "chapters": [
        189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "made-in-haste",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_first_gen_gu_yue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Bai Gu mountain, Fang Yuan ranks gains from White Bone Inheritance above this flower wine inheritance, because Grey Bone Scholar planned that site for a long time while the Monk finished his in haste, even though the Monk was rank five and Grey Bone Scholar only rank four.",
      "chapters": [
        228
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "made-in-haste",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
        "inh_white_bone_inheritance",
        "char_grey_bone_scholar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later recall states the Monk hid those Gu worms inside earth treasury flower Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        433
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "made-in-haste",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    }
  ],
